{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "season_b_004_tunaepi_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_004_tunaepi_title", "source_sha256": "29c1fa090965a31a52de878d448bc36339204dd3a048b4749691d361fb01685e", "ja": "エピローグ", "zh": "尾声", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "season_b_004_tunaepi_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_004_tunaepi_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "2b1dc3296cd33eac7fbac10070b05a7c80c7f4520f75248806c09b2fc39b577d", "ja": "社長さんっ！　7つの譜面、全部集められました～！", "zh": "社长！我把七张乐谱全部收集回来了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "season_b_004_tunaepi_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_004_tunaepi_1001_president", "source_sha256": "10bd3d3f34140e86c1e690d699ddd489f78f69114d46dfac3a33b84eb22af9e1", "ja": "おお！　青羽君、ご苦労様！\nずいぶんと時間がかかったようだね。", "zh": "哦哦！青羽，辛苦你了！\n看来花了不少时间啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "season_b_004_tunaepi_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_004_tunaepi_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "8e7faf6e9c64b26a4f3b5e0af3714c06f970d442c3e4b69180a2682ba67cabd3", "ja": "すみません、思ったより流されていたみたいで、\n追いかけるのに苦労しちゃいました。", "zh": "对不起，乐谱漂流得比想像中还远，\n所以我费了好大的力气去追乐谱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "season_b_004_tunaepi_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_004_tunaepi_1003_101kot", "source_sha256": "ea2840966a1b6c99aa05b3e416133821892cbe5fc2f729b0255abc06e39c53d9", "ja": "本当に大変だったんですよ、社長！", "zh": "她真的收集得很辛苦喔，社长！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "season_b_004_tunaepi_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_004_tunaepi_1004_president", "source_sha256": "3fd234342b459085fae72c260b5d062b0af634fe6e22d02520e20ccd1ad4a6cf", "ja": "おや、音無君じゃないか。\n君も来てくれていたのか！", "zh": "哎呀，这不是音无吗？\n你也来了啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "season_b_004_tunaepi_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_004_tunaepi_1005_101kot", "source_sha256": "78d61a6c120c2ed6894a9cddfea07e60be9a88991107ec70c78f23caf9b956b5", "ja": "もちろんです！　かわいい後輩事務員を\n1人にするわけにはいきませんから。", "zh": "那当然！我可不能丢下\n可爱的后辈事务员独自奋斗啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "season_b_004_tunaepi_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_004_tunaepi_1006_101kot", "source_sha256": "cfd0e9cdaaba2b7230faa1420b7e4a1624c414ab87e651e54575205e110d4193", "ja": "……いつの間にか、他にもいっぱい\nゲストがいたような気がしますけど……。", "zh": "……虽然好像在不知不觉间\n还多了不少其他的客人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "season_b_004_tunaepi_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_004_tunaepi_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "00a9a9fc549c29d8b052af56b842278c985d4693d345bf0848890e9189e1941e", "ja": "でも、ちゃんと譜面を集められて良かったです。\nこれで次の公演も、無事に開催できますね！", "zh": "不过，能把乐谱完整收集回来真的太好了。\n这样子，下次的公演也能顺利举行了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "season_b_004_tunaepi_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_004_tunaepi_1008_president", "source_sha256": "119618a562bb9a4a12047e2d3af2fdac25a25d779ccfa275a3ddf00a8623173e", "ja": "青羽君、音無君、今回は本当に助かった。\n公演が終わったら、すき焼きでもご馳走しよう！", "zh": "青羽、音无，这次你们真的帮了大忙。\n等公演结束后，我请你们吃寿喜烧吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "season_b_004_tunaepi_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_004_tunaepi_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "34742ab20eab44505e619fe7a39138e17af7bc296aab9ffcab4566733f226459", "ja": "わぁ、本当ですか？\nえへへ、楽しみにしていますね♪", "zh": "哇～真的吗？\n嘿嘿，我会好好期待的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "season_b_004_tunaepi_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_004_tunaepi_1010_101kot", "source_sha256": "d8a7a065e73568a5818b83d83fca14cedb22982ab19ea59dbd61f1b67ce68566", "ja": "ふふっ、{$P$}さんも呼んであげて\nくださいね！　今日もきっとどこかで見守って……。", "zh": "呵呵，也要找{$P$}先生一起去喔！\n他今天肯定也在某处默默守护大家……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "season_b_004_tunaepi_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_004_tunaepi_1011_101kot", "source_sha256": "25166da7d9d00977fdc94e7a5f8b025caa59ed7a72c6b0233596f92c89fc6728", "ja": "あっ、そうだわ、美咲ちゃん。\n例のアレ、私もやってみていいかしら？", "zh": "啊，对了，美咲。\n之前提到的那个，也能让我试试看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "season_b_004_tunaepi_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_004_tunaepi_1012_101kot", "source_sha256": "883000b46528e7e374b0b8d023003f975141eaea3783861ca3fe0b56da711573", "ja": "今日の美咲ちゃんのがんばりを見て、思ったの。\n先輩事務員として、私もがんばらなくちゃって！", "zh": "看到美咲今天的努力，也让我产生了新想法。\n身为前辈事务员，我想我也得加油才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "season_b_004_tunaepi_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_004_tunaepi_1013_102mis", "source_sha256": "d999ab09d14e42ce81fe3ce3cd8b4722c7f35921a7ce477cbe82c74008df9b47", "ja": "あっ、例のアレですね？　わかりました！\nよろしくお願いします、音無先輩！", "zh": "啊，之前提到的那个吗？我知道了！\n那就麻烦你了，音无前辈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "season_b_004_tunaepi_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_004_tunaepi_1014_101kot", "source_sha256": "d8fa7cb388a7deef6cbaec86a3adefbcca67425b04f901d57eacc17ec9467f8f", "ja": "ありがとう！　うふふっ、音無小鳥、\n久しぶりに本気を出しちゃいますよ～♪", "zh": "谢谢你！呵呵，音无小鸟，\n要拿出尘封已久的真本事啰～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "season_b_004_tunaepi_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_004_tunaepi_1015_101kot", "source_sha256": "dd077e98938697bdfad9ab4d0327b1b0e4407999c93971f176192295002a4c3a", "ja": "それから社長？\n美咲ちゃんのすき焼きは、特上でお願いしますね？", "zh": "然后，社长。\n请美咲吃的寿喜烧，麻烦要顶级的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "season_b_004_tunaepi_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_004_tunaepi_1016_president", "source_sha256": "f25aa5894d802fa00bb0e7cfbbf08a1c35c61dfe518cb37670702b9ba797376c", "ja": "えっ……。いやいやいや、我が765プロの資金繰りの\n微妙さは、君もよく知っているだろう？", "zh": "咦……不不不，我们765艺能的资金周转\n是多么一言难尽，你也很清楚吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "season_b_004_tunaepi_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_004_tunaepi_1017_101kot", "source_sha256": "92a0eefda57232e0270b39f4e829715d0f923679f3f21c34af3241f3f4dd3597", "ja": "もう、誰のせいで美咲ちゃんが、\nあんなに頑張ることになったと思ってるんですか！", "zh": "真是的，社长你以为这都要怪谁，\n才害得美咲要这么拚命啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "season_b_004_tunaepi_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_004_tunaepi_1018_101kot", "source_sha256": "5849a4b203bb7591e6806a95764ce056c4e300d9f3d809da615589d397436c8b", "ja": "海を越え、山を越え、時には潜り、最後は大気圏も\n越えて……美咲ちゃん、本当に大活躍だったんですよ？", "zh": "她可是翻山越海，时而潜入水中，最后甚至\n还穿越了大气层……美咲真的表现得很活跃喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "season_b_004_tunaepi_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_004_tunaepi_1019_president", "source_sha256": "aae8bd06c4b828f7fa2626980e0952027a940753633f24c47d19c6e03527f57f", "ja": "大気圏まで！？　なんということだ……！\nいや、あらためてよく頑張ってくれた、青羽君！", "zh": "还去到了大气层！？竟然会这么拚命……！\n哎呀，你真的很努力了，青羽！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "season_b_004_tunaepi_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_004_tunaepi_1020_102mis", "source_sha256": "17f103814421b8bbf04ffa0f7ce79efb9ccd43e3c28104402d8d38f54f4fefd0", "ja": "いいえ、私も久しぶりにいっぱい釣りができて、\nとっても楽しかったです！", "zh": "别这么说，我也好久没有钓得这么尽兴，\n真的很开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "season_b_004_tunaepi_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_004_tunaepi_1021_102mis", "source_sha256": "4896043ea8d7b37abaea8753df11232da0d88aa91d939ba36ad9319748048b0b", "ja": "社長さんを襲った怪獣も出てこなかったし。\n助かりました～。", "zh": "而且袭击社长的怪兽也没有出现，\n真的是太好了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "season_b_004_tunaepi_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_004_tunaepi_1022_president", "source_sha256": "1221212859cd76e7c9ced3aa3581fa22ab1be31a275c9c690119181c5b334835", "ja": "そ、そうか……。\nそれはその、ら、ラッキーだったね？", "zh": "这、这样啊……\n那还真是……幸、幸运对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "season_b_004_tunaepi_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_004_tunaepi_1023_101kot", "source_sha256": "13719b2986ff41cc92d12cc5d0f0f780964ee6b1dc46602507baeffeffc1caf1", "ja": "社長？　怪獣に襲われたって、何のお話ですか？", "zh": "社长？你被怪兽袭击是怎么回事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "season_b_004_tunaepi_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_004_tunaepi_1024_president", "source_sha256": "10b0e70812475c083435c2491e4807f3653daccb899f6a769465ae49fa366b3f", "ja": "あ、いや、音無君には話していなかったかな？\n実はその……私が今朝、海に楽譜を落とした原因は……", "zh": "啊，哎呀，我好像还没有对音无说过吧？\n其实那个……我今早把乐谱掉到海里的原因……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "season_b_004_tunaepi_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_004_tunaepi_1025_president", "source_sha256": "271d1714e71864f385f3f557a1249eeb9d7c90e09657adaca67299c86b9bb553", "ja": "海から現れた怪獣に襲われたからなのだよ！", "zh": "是因为我被海里出现的怪兽袭击了啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "season_b_004_tunaepi_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_004_tunaepi_1027_101kot", "source_sha256": "cf6c3da94e0c4ccbbc1b1d881a7d7da2ade6ec6c7134ef3b1e9f39cadea32e0f", "ja": "そうですか、あれは怪獣だったんですか。\n私には、カモメにしか見えませんでしたけど……？", "zh": "这样啊，原来那个是怪兽啊。\n在我眼里倒是怎么看都像海鸥呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "season_b_004_tunaepi_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_004_tunaepi_1028_president", "source_sha256": "6460b1c9e6d8c26f9a9e8fb68fc9624b45d526b323c295d554880f9b0af99f68", "ja": "なんとっ！？　お、音無君、もしかして君は……\n全部、見ていたのかねっ！？", "zh": "什么！？音、音无，该不会你……\n全部都看到了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "season_b_004_tunaepi_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_004_tunaepi_1029_101kot", "source_sha256": "b5d0717d0b8ff95e7a97ef196578dcf52e1f34316c1333662b10fd1767e7efe5", "ja": "はい、しっかりと！　可愛らしいカモメがちょっぴり\n近くを飛んだだけで、驚いた社長が楽譜を落とす所を！", "zh": "是的，看得一清二楚！只不过是可爱的海鸥\n飞到旁边而已，社长就吓得把乐谱给弄掉了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "season_b_004_tunaepi_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_004_tunaepi_1030_102mis", "source_sha256": "8835ba35ab4e1226dfe9b6149d61337d59514a9e462729d762439e570afc4c3d", "ja": "ええ～っ！？　それじゃあ、もしかして社長さんは、\n怪獣に襲われたんじゃなかったんですか！？", "zh": "咦咦～！？这么说的话，\n社长其实并不是被怪兽给袭击了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "season_b_004_tunaepi_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_004_tunaepi_1031_president", "source_sha256": "fe04cdd3cdf1de067796bbe15ab203b1e4068b88538b5f8c8722aefdfc9a9a88", "ja": "す、すまないっ！　ほんのおちゃめな冗談のつもり\nだったんだが、青羽君が信じてしまったもので……！", "zh": "很、很抱歉！我本来是想开点小玩笑，\n但没想到青羽真的相信了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "season_b_004_tunaepi_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_004_tunaepi_1032_president", "source_sha256": "79694e4834610ea6952ad1d1aacc0e2d9f22d04ae3c19227896d9cc1dea7f01a", "ja": "あ、今のは言葉のあやで、決して青羽君のせいに\nしたわけではなく……とにかく、許してくれ！", "zh": "啊，刚那句话是我措词有问题，我绝对不是\n要把错推到青羽身上……总之，请原谅我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "season_b_004_tunaepi_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_004_tunaepi_1033_101kot", "source_sha256": "b33c198de3faaf70f3ea6d89d4d184a3cf3c7edeba6f71823da9f0a1b89f3072", "ja": "いいえ、許しません！　社長の……", "zh": "不行，不可原谅！社长这个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
